I</span>·<span data-text=\"bene\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"bene\">BENE</span>⸙<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"requiesce\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"requiesco\">[.......]CE</span>☧<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-text=\"in\" data-n=\"75\" data-lemma=\"in\">[..</span><span data-text=\"pace\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"pax\">....</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Sertoria\"><span data-text=\"Sertoria\" data-n=\"85\" data-lemma=\"Sertoria\">..]RTORIA</span></span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\">l.1 subscript</p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"hic\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"hic\">HIC</span><span data-text=\"posita\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"pono\">POSITA</span><span data-text=\"Aurelia\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Aurelia\">AURELIA</span><span data-text=\"quae\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"qui\">QUAE</span><span data-text=\"vixit\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"vivo\">VIXIT</span><span data-text=\"annos\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"annus\">ANNOS</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-text=\"III\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"III\">III</span><span data-text=\"bene\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"bene\">BENE</span><span data-text=\"requiesce\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"requiesco\">REQUIESCE</span><span data-text=\"in\" data-n=\"75\" data-lemma=\"in\">IN</span><span data-text=\"pace\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"pax\">PACE</span><span data-text=\"Sertoria\" data-n=\"85\" data-lemma=\"Sertoria\">SERTORIA</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text of Agnello with suggestions of Ferrua</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"Line 4\">Line.4: <span>[in pa]ce Cri(isti), Agnello</span>  </span><br></li><li><span class=\"LIne 5\">LIne.5: <span>(vacat) [Se]rtoria, Agnello; vel [in pace Ma]rtoria, Ferrua</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2> translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>Lower fragment was published by Orsi in 1893; upper fragment by Carini in 1874; Mommsen only aware of upper fragment; Agnello united the fragments, and Ferrua amended the reading.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Carini 1874 510 no.11 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002091\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002091</a>  </li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/item/buchseite/650769\" target=\"_blank\">7170</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li><li> Orsi 1893 292 no. 59 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001715\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001715</a>  </li><li> Agnello 1956 55 no.8 fig.1e <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002208\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002208</a>  </li><li> Ferrua 1989 33 no.100 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001995\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001995</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
